WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.800
The app measures your computer and recommends a model that will run well.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.800
Open the recommended card: you see the download size, the memory needed and where it will be saved.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.800
Tick the model's licence box, then press “Download and install”.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:26.800
That's all. You can pause, or even close the window: the download keeps going in the background.

